        <h2 id="too-high">The shipping cost seems too high for the item</h2>

        <p>We'll help review the shipping charge if you believe you paid more than expected because a seller listed an item with incorrect weight or size.</p>

        <p><a href="#">Contact Support</a> for help with your order and include any relevant details. Our team will take a closer look and guide you on next steps.</p>

        <h2 id="customs">You were charged custom, duties, or import fees</h2>

        <p>If your order is shipped internationally, customs, duties, or import fees are charged by your country's customs agency, not by Lively or the seller.</p>

        <p>These fees are standard import costs and are the buyer's responsibility. If you refuse to pay them, the order won't qualify for a refund.</p>

        <p><strong>Learn more:</strong> <a href="#">International shipping and import fees.</a></p>

